#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to port existing code to leverage Qiskit Serverless"
msgstr "Qiskit Serverless를 활용하기 위해 기존 코드를 이식하는 방법"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Port code to Qiskit Serverless"
msgstr "Qiskit Serverless로 코드 이식하기"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless는 업그레이드 중이며, 기능이 빠르게 변화하고 있습니다.** 개발 단계 동안 릴리스 노트와 최신 문서는 [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) 페이지에서 확인하세요.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following example demonstrates how to port existing code to leverage Qiskit Serverless.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The following code assumes that you have saved your credentials. If you have not, follow the instructions in [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) to authenticate with your API key.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"다음 예시는 Qiskit Serverless를 활용하기 위해 기존 코드를 이식하는 방법을 보여줍니다.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"다음 코드는 자격 증명이 저장되어 있다고 가정합니다. 저장하지 않으셨다면, [IBM Cloud 계정 설정](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) 페이지의 지침에 따라 API 키로 인증하세요.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update the experiment {#update-the-experiment}"
msgstr "실험 업데이트 {#update-the-experiment}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-11
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"In the Serverless version, create the runtime service with `get_runtime_service()` (from `qiskit_serverless`) instead of `QiskitRuntimeService()`, so that the IBM Quantum&reg; Compute Service jobs and sessions it launches are tracked against the parent Qiskit Serverless job. See [Write your first Qiskit Serverless program](/guides/serverless-first-program) for details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Serverless 버전에서는 `QiskitRuntimeService()` 대신 (`qiskit_serverless`의) `get_runtime_service()`로 런타임 서비스를 생성하면, 해당 서비스가 시작하는 IBM Quantum&reg; Compute Service 작업과 세션이 상위 Qiskit Serverless 작업에 연결되어 추적됩니다. 자세한 내용은 [첫 번째 Qiskit Serverless 프로그램 작성](/guides/serverless-first-program)을 참조하세요.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"LocalExperiment\" label=\"Local Experiment\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"LocalExperiment\" label=\"로컬 실험\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr "  </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  <TabItem value=\"Serverless\" label=\"Serverless\">\n"
msgstr "  <TabItem value=\"Serverless\" label=\"Serverless\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    ```python\n"
msgstr "    ```python\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "transpile_remote.py"
msgstr "transpile_remote.py"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"from qiskit_serverless import get_arguments, save_result, distribute_task, get, get_runtime_service\n"
msgstr ""
"from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"from qiskit_serverless import get_arguments, save_result, distribute_task, get, get_runtime_service\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-09 · verified 2026-09-11
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get program arguments"
msgstr "프로그램 인자 가져오기"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"arguments = get_arguments()\n"
"circuits = arguments.get(\"circuits\")\n"
"backend_name = arguments.get(\"backend_name\")\n"
"optimization_level = arguments.get(\"optimization_level\")\n"
"pass_manager = generate_preset_pass_manager(\n"
"    optimization_level=optimization_level, backend=backend_name\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""
"arguments = get_arguments()\n"
"circuits = arguments.get(\"circuits\")\n"
"backend_name = arguments.get(\"backend_name\")\n"
"optimization_level = arguments.get(\"optimization_level\")\n"
"pass_manager = generate_preset_pass_manager(\n"
"    optimization_level=optimization_level, backend=backend_name\n"
")\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-09 · verified 2026-09-11
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribute task across workers"
msgstr "작업자에게 작업 분배"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"@distribute_task(target={\"cpu\": 1})\n"
"def transpile_parallel(circuit, pass_manager):\n"
"    \"\"\"Distributed transpilation for an abstract circuit into an ISA circuit for a given backend.\"\"\"\n"
msgstr ""
"@distribute_task(target={\"cpu\": 1})\n"
"def transpile_parallel(circuit, pass_manager):\n"
"    \"\"\"Distributed transpilation for an abstract circuit into an ISA circuit for a given backend.\"\"\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    isa_circuit = pass_manager.run(circuit)\n"
msgstr "    isa_circuit = pass_manager.run(circuit)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    return isa_circuit\n"
msgstr "    return isa_circuit\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"try:\n"
"    # Get backend\n"
"    service = get_runtime_service()\n"
"    backend = service.get_backend(backend_name)\n"
msgstr ""
"try:\n"
"    # Get backend\n"
"    service = get_runtime_service()\n"
"    backend = service.get_backend(backend_name)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # run distributed tasks as async function\n"
"    # we get task references as a return type\n"
"    sample_task_references = [\n"
"        transpile_parallel(circuit, pass_manager)\n"
"        for circuit in circuits\n"
"    ]\n"
msgstr ""
"    # run distributed tasks as async function\n"
"    # we get task references as a return type\n"
"    sample_task_references = [\n"
"        transpile_parallel(circuit, pass_manager)\n"
"        for circuit in circuits\n"
"    ]\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-09 · verified 2026-09-11
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # now we need to collect results from task references\n"
"    results = get(sample_task_references)\n"
msgstr ""
"    # 이제 작업 참조에서 결과를 수집해야 합니다\n"
"    results = get(sample_task_references)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # Return results\n"
"    save_result({\n"
"        \"transpiled_circuits\": results\n"
"    })\n"
msgstr ""
"    # Return results\n"
"    save_result({\n"
"        \"transpiled_circuits\": results\n"
"    })\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"except Exception as e:\n"
"    # Exception handling\n"
"    import traceback\n"
"    print(traceback.format_exc())\n"
msgstr ""
"except Exception as e:\n"
"    # Exception handling\n"
"    import traceback\n"
"    print(traceback.format_exc())\n"

